WEBVTT

00:04:28.156 --> 00:04:30.116
our water catchments,

00:04:30.116 --> 00:04:31.956
our bottles and our buckets.

00:04:33.156 --> 00:04:39.156
Our government has had to declare
a state of national emergency,

00:04:39.156 --> 00:04:41.116
calling for help from our friends.

00:04:43.116 --> 00:04:44.516
Sea-level rising,

00:04:44.516 --> 00:04:45.516
flooding,

00:04:45.516 --> 00:04:46.516
droughts,

00:04:46.516 --> 00:04:52.876
erosion have been the reality
of my people for many, many, many years.

00:04:55.516 --> 00:04:57.196
We’ve been told to move.

00:04:58.316 --> 00:05:01.036
To become climate change refugees.